":null,"fix":"Fix the misspelled words."},{"meter":"trust","id":"T14","q":"Is the copy free of pressure tactics (act now, last chance, only 3 left, countdowns)?","yes":"No pressure phrase.","w":5,"kind":"code","jev":"","pushes":null,"fix":"Remove the countdown or scarcity wording."},{"meter":"trust","id":"T15","q":"Does the copy sound human but professional (not stiff or corporate, not slangy)?","yes":"The tone is plain, human and professional.","w":7,"kind":"code","jev":"","pushes":null,"fix":"Write the way a helpful professional would speak."},{"meter":"vv","id":"vv1","q":"Is the main page background light (white, cream or pale tint)?","yes":"Background lightness is light","w":20,"kind":"jev","jev":"Is this true? Is the main page background light (white, cream or pale tint)?","pushes":"high","fix":"Move the main background to a light tone."},{"meter":"vv","id":"vv2","q":"Do cool colors (blue, green, teal, purple) or neutrals make up most of the colored area?","yes":"Cool/neutral hues cover over half the colored area","w":8,"kind":"jev","jev":"Is this true? Do cool colors (blue, green, teal, purple) or neutrals make up most of the colored area?","pushes":"high","fix":"Shift the main accent to a blue or green."},{"meter":"vv","id":"vv3","q":"Does empty space surround the main headline on at least two sides?","yes":"Visible margin around the headline","w":13,"kind":"jev","jev":"Is this true? Does empty space surround the main headline on at least two sides?","pushes":"high","fix":"Add space around the headline."},{"meter":"vv","id":"vv5","q":"Are there more than 4 different text/accent colors on screen?","yes":"5 or more distinct hues","w":12,"kind":"jev","jev":"Is this true? Are there more than 4 different text/accent colors on screen?","pushes":"low","fix":"Cut the palette to one accent color."},{"meter":"vv","id":"vv7","q":"Is the page background black or near-black?","yes":"Background lightness is dark","w":20,"kind":"jev","jev":"Is this true? Is the page background black or near-black?","pushes":"low","fix":"No fix needed if dark is a brand choice; it just reads less pleasant."},{"meter":"vv","id":"vv9","q":"Is the most-used accent color vivid (bright, fully saturated)?","yes":"The accent color is vivid.","w":27,"kind":"code","jev":"Is this true of the screen? Is the most-used accent color vivid (bright, fully saturated)? Yes means: The accent color is vivid.","pushes":"high","fix":"Use a more vivid accent color."},{"meter":"vi","id":"vi1","q":"Is the most-used accent color vivid (bright, fully saturated) rather than muted or pastel?","yes":"Saturation level is vivid","w":32,"kind":"jev","jev":"Is this true? Is the most-used accent color vivid (bright, fully saturated) rather than muted or pastel?","pushes":"high","fix":"Desaturate the main accent."},{"meter":"vi","id":"vi3","q":"Are there 4 or more separate colored blocks competing for attention?","yes":"4+ colored blocks","w":4,"kind":"jev","jev":"Is this true? Are there 4 or more separate colored blocks competing for attention?","pushes":"high","fix":"Reduce to one colored block."},{"meter":"vi","id":"vi4","q":"Is there a full-width gradient, or a large (over a quarter of the screen) multicolor image or ribbon?","yes":"Large multicolor area present","w":4,"kind":"jev","jev":"Is this true? Is there a full-width gradient, or a large (over a quarter of the screen) multicolor image or ribbon?","pushes":"high","fix":"Use a flat single-tone background."},{"meter":"vi","id":"vi5","q":"Is the page mostly one hue family plus neutrals (grays, white, black)?","yes":"Palette is single hue plus neutrals","w":4,"kind":"jev","jev":"Is this true? Is the page mostly one hue family plus neutrals (grays, white, black)?","pushes":"low","fix":"Keep it this way for calm."},{"meter":"vi","id":"vi6","q":"Is the saturation of the largest colored area muted or pastel?","yes":"Saturation is muted","w":32,"kind":"jev","jev":"Is this true? Is the saturation of the largest colored area muted or pastel?","pushes":"low","fix":"Keep the muted tone for calm."},{"meter":"vi","id":"vi7","q":"Does more than 40 percent of the screen stay empty (no text, image or color)?","yes":"Empty area over 40 percent","w":4,"kind":"jev","jev":"Is this true? Does more than 40 percent of the screen stay empty (no text, image or color)?","pushes":"low","fix":"Add whitespace to calm the page."},{"meter":"vi","id":"vi8","q":"Are all headline weights regular or medium and no text is larger than 3 times body size?","yes":"No very large, ultra-bold type","w":4,"kind":"jev","jev":"Is this true? Are all headline weights regular or medium and no text is larger than 3 times body size?","pushes":"low","fix":"Lower headline weight and size."},{"meter":"vi","id":"vi9","q":"Is the page background dark (darker colors raise arousal)?","yes":"The main background is dark.","w":16,"kind":"code","jev":"Is this true of the screen? Is the page background dark (darker colors raise arousal)? Yes means: The main background is dark.","pushes":"high","fix":"Use a lighter background to calm the page."},{"meter":"cv","id":"cv1","q":"Does any headline or button name a benefit gained (save, grow, simple, free, easy, clear)?","yes":"At least one gain word in headline/button","w":16,"kind":"jev","jev":"Is this true? Does any headline or button name a benefit gained (save, grow, simple, free, easy, clear)?","pushes":"high","fix":"Lead the headline with what the reader gains."},{"meter":"cv","id":"cv3","q":"Do at least 3 words in the copy come from a positive list (love, simple, easy, free, better, great, clear, fast, joy, welcome)?","yes":"3+ positive-list words","w":16,"kind":"jev","jev":"Is this true? Do at least 3 words in the copy come from a positive list (love, simple, easy, free, better, great, clear, fast, joy, welcome)?","pushes":"high","fix":"Swap neutral nouns for plain positive words."},{"meter":"cv","id":"cv4","q":"Is the tone welcoming (greeting, thanks, or an offer with no cost)?","yes":"Welcome/free/